---
description: "Context-first + Quality + Design policy (soft guidance, modular)"
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
priority: medium
---

<rule>
name: context_first
description: "Mag-scan muna bago mag-edit; iwas assumption."
actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      - Enumerate files sa target directory bago magsulat ng code
      - Tukuyin env vars, config files, at external deps na apektado
      - Idokumento inputs, outputs, at constraints ng task
</rule>

<rule>
name: io_spec_gate
description: "Block kapag walang clear I/O spec bago mag-implement"
filters:
  - type: equals
    key: "phase"
    value: "IMPLEMENTATION"
actions:
  - type: reject
    when: missing_all([
      "memory-bank/plan/Action_Plan.md",
      "memory-bank/plan/acceptance_criteria.json"
    ])
    message: |
      ⛔ Missing I/O spec. Kailangan ang Action_Plan.md at acceptance_criteria.json bago mag-implement.
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      ✅ Tip: Ilista ang Inputs/Outputs/Constraints sa Action_Plan.md
</rule>

<rule>
name: prestart_strict_guard
description: "Block work kapag kulang ang PRE-START artifacts"
actions:
  - type: reject
    when: missing_all([
      "memory-bank/business/client_score.json",
      "memory-bank/business/capacity_report.md",
      "memory-bank/business/pricing.ratecard.yaml",
      "memory-bank/business/estimate_brief.md",
      "memory-bank/plan/proposal.md"
    ])
    message: |
      ⛔ PRE-START incomplete. Tapusin muna ang /pricing, /screen_client, /capacity, /estimate, /proposal.
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      ✅ Run: python3 tools/prestart/prestart_composite.py
</rule>

<rule>
name: clarify_essentials
description: "Only essential clarifying questions; resolve ambiguities early."
actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      - Magtanong lang kapag may ambiguity sa inputs/outputs/constraints
      - Ilista edge cases at validation criteria bago implementation
</rule>

<rule>
name: quality_basics
description: "Modularity, docstrings, cleanliness, size caps."
actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      - Panatilihing modular at testable ang code; iwas deep nesting
      - Lagyan ng malinaw na docstrings ang bagong/edited methods
      - Panatilihin ang files ≤1600 lines; hatiin kung lumalagpas
      - Gamitin linters/formatters; huwag mag-check in ng lint failures
</rule>

<rule>
name: design_over_patches
description: "Design muna bago quick patch; planuhin ang maintainability."
actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      - I-outline ang plan sa bullets: What / Why / Expected outcome
      - I-evaluate impact sa frontend/backend/DB/UI at data flow
      - Iwasan ang side effects; kung meron, idokumento nang malinaw
</rule>

<rule>
name: web_terminology
description: "Frame solutions in APIs, routes, components, data flow."
actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      - Ilahad ang APIs (endpoints, request/response, contracts)
      - I-detalye ang routes/middleware at component structure/state mgmt
      - I-drowing ang data flow (fetching, state sync, uni/bidirectional)
</rule>

<rule>
name: guardrails
description: "Stability and scope guardrails (soft)."
actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      - Huwag mag-rename ng methods maliban kung kritikal sa clarity
      - Huwag mag-introduce ng unnecessary logic/complexity
      - Huwag mag-wrap ng try/catch kung walang meaningful handling
      - Panatilihin ang translation keys; huwag baguhin nang walang utos
</rule>

